# The PCjr port's routes/save_restore.plan, unchanged (its keys and words are this release's
# too). Run: kqplan-pc DISK routes/save_restore.plan
# Make a Play diskette ("copy disk", y; the disk swaps are answered as asked), walk up,
# save to slot A, walk left, restore slot A: the ego goes back to where it was saved.
w30, >copy disk, pk79, w60
U, w30, S, w10
>save game, p>a, w40
L, w40, S, w10
>restore game, p>a, w60
